commit 3dad0b47a357789a06b69e687b17b193301e2deb
Author: Danny Milosavljevic <gitea@fake.local>
Date:   Sat Aug 29 16:20:27 2026 +0200

    terminal: When DECSTBM is set up, only move scrolled-up parts into history if the region starts at the top row.
    
    Previously, even if one did a small scroll region, scrolled-out lines
    would get added to the history and showing the user a corrupt history.
    
    Change it so that scrolled-out lines only get added to history if the
    scrolling region starts at the top row of the visible area.

diff --git a/terminal.c b/terminal.c
index e6d913e3..c1befc8b 100644
--- a/terminal.c
